{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "到了考试前最后一天，星期一。", "text_idx": 120, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "早上还是和以往一样的例行全校集会。", "text_idx": 121, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『——不过，从下周开始暂时就不开全校集会了。\\n　问理由就太不懂事了所以别问』", "text_idx": 123, "plain": "『——不过，从下周开始暂时就不开全校集会了。　问理由就太不懂事了所以别问』", "plain_idx": 124, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0050", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但这个惯例，似乎也只持续到今天。", "text_idx": 127, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "讲台上的校长用手压住了台下疑惑的声音，\\n无奈地耸了耸肩。", "text_idx": 128, "plain": "讲台上的校长用手压住了台下疑惑的声音，无奈地耸了耸肩。", "plain_idx": 129, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后就这样慢慢环视了我们一圈。", "text_idx": 130, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她平时总是在煽动学生，\\n但是今天……感觉没那个兴致？", "text_idx": 131, "plain": "她平时总是在煽动学生，但是今天……感觉没那个兴致？", "plain_idx": 132, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原本有些不满的大家，似乎也发现了端倪，\\n又重新看向了校长。", "text_idx": 133, "plain": "原本有些不满的大家，似乎也发现了端倪，又重新看向了校长。", "plain_idx": 134, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……行了！\\n　明天开始就是考试了，你们也知道吧？』", "text_idx": 135, "plain": "『……行了！　明天开始就是考试了，你们也知道吧？』", "plain_idx": 136, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0051", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "校长在绝妙的时机切换了话题。", "text_idx": 138, "plain": "校长在绝妙的时机切换了话题。", "plain_idx": 138, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "手段还是一如既往地高超，\\n学生们果然一个个都上钩了。", "text_idx": 139, "plain": "手段还是一如既往地高超，学生们果然一个个都上钩了。", "plain_idx": 140, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『作为一个好女人，知性是不可或缺的。\\n　这方面男生就算稍微蠢一点倒也没事……』", "text_idx": 141, "plain": "『作为一个好女人，知性是不可或缺的。　这方面男生就算稍微蠢一点倒也没事……』", "plain_idx": 142, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0052", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『不过，现在你们作为结女校的一员，\\n　就要按我的方针来』", "text_idx": 144, "plain": "『不过，现在你们作为结女校的一员，　就要按我的方针来』", "plain_idx": 145, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0053", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『简单来说就是，大家加油考试吧』。", "text_idx": 147, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种事就算不用说也已经在礼堂中传开了，\\n学生们一齐露出了严肃的表情。", "text_idx": 148, "plain": "这种事就算不用说也已经在礼堂中传开了，学生们一齐露出了严肃的表情。", "plain_idx": 149, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就好像，不能让那位校长看见自己丢脸的样子一样。", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——啊，这就是结女校考试前的氛围么。", "text_idx": 151, "plain": "——啊，这就是结女校考试前的氛围么。", "plain_idx": 151, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……结女校的大家，\\n　也许这句话我已经说过很多次了，但我还是要说』", "text_idx": 152, "plain": "『……结女校的大家，　也许这句话我已经说过很多次了，但我还是要说』", "plain_idx": 153, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0054", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "校长在讲台上莞尔一笑。", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『所谓人啊，无论何时，都在寻找自己的另一半』", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0055", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『所以啊，\\n　为了相遇的那一刻，你们要成为一名好女人』", "text_idx": 158, "plain": "『所以啊，　为了相遇的那一刻，你们要成为一名好女人』", "plain_idx": 159, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0056", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总觉得，令人印象深刻。", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你怎么一脸感慨啊。\\n　想成为好女人吗？」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": "「你怎么一脸感慨啊。　想成为好女人吗？」", "plain_idx": 165, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0546", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇恶心」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0098", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同学原来有女装的兴趣呀」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0278", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是Ｍ，新吾则是女装么～」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0156", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_16.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我说你们啊」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
